     Example 2: number of elements in 2nd dimension (columns)

          size ([1, 2; 3, 4; 5, 6], 2)
              ⇒ 2

     Example 3: number of output arguments == number of dimensions

          [nr, nc] = size ([1, 2; 3, 4; 5, 6])
