     must be a positive integer.  Specifying any singleton dimension in
     X, including any dimension exceeding ‘ndims (X)’, will return X.

     Specifying multiple dimensions with input VECDIM, a vector of
     non-repeating dimensions, will operate along the array slice
     defined by VECDIM.  If VECDIM indexes all dimensions of X, then it
     is equivalent to the option "all".  Any dimension in VECDIM greater
     than ‘ndims (X)’ is ignored.

