          precision inputs.  Output is of type double.

     "extra"
          For double precision inputs, ‘sum’ will use a more accurate
          algorithm than straightforward summation.  For single
          precision inputs, "extra" is the same as "double".  For all
          other data types, "extra" has no effect.

     "native"
