 -- G = givens (X, Y)
 -- [C, S] = givens (X, Y)
     Compute the Givens rotation matrix G.  The Givens matrix is a
     2-by-2 orthogonal matrix

          G = [ C , S
               -S', C]

     such that

          G * [X; Y] = [*; 0]

